      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Nice race this between the top two. MARSEPT (2) returns for team Hawkes and shoulders an attractive form-profile, ending last campaign with a Flemington placing as fav behind Wise Inlaw. Her Geelong win over Varadero prior was dominant, and before that she was a length off the now G1-placed Extragalactic. Will take plenty of stitching fresh. LAYLA (6) rates the clear main danger. She was a dominant track-and-trip winner here back in Jan to get off the mark, before being sent to town to tackle a handy field at Flemington. All signs point to a bold return after two smart Flem jumpouts. Can't leave BRUTAL WORLD (7) out of the numbers as she shoots for the hat-trick, while MYKINDAKANDY (3)returns and looks best of the rest.",
